exports[`templates > renders each template to stable html and css 2`] = `"<link rel="preload" as="image" href="/landing-page-templates/saas-subscription/hero-mockup.png" fetchPriority="high"/><div class="s-site"><main class="s-page s-2dqmmry9c0p"><header class="s-section s-1oydg1zgca3"><div class="s-inner"><div class="s-container s-1e5px9b7j7o"><div class="s-rich s-t-lead s-cch9w5bisp"><p><strong>Aurora</strong></p></div><div class="s-container s-18ephyprl2b"><nav aria-label="Menu principal" class="s-menu s-menu-collapse-tablet s-r32ndn2l3s"><ul class="s-menu-list s-t-body s-menu-inline"><li><a class="s-menu-link" href="#servicos">Serviços</a></li><li><a class="s-menu-link" href="#sobre">Sobre</a></li><li><a class="s-menu-link" href="#depoimentos">Depoimentos</a></li><li><a class="s-menu-link" href="#contato">Contato</a></li></ul><details class="s-menu-burger"><summary aria-label="Abrir menu"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 5L20 5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></path><path d="M4 12L20 12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></path><path d="M4 19L20 19" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg></summary><ul class="s-menu-list s-t-body"><li><a class="s-menu-link" href="#servicos">Serviços</a></li><li><a class="s-menu-link" href="#sobre">Sobre</a></li><li><a class="s-menu-link" href="#depoimentos">Depoimentos</a></li><li><a class="s-menu-link" href="#contato">Contato</a></li></ul></details></nav><div class="s-button s-uexhr5c1ic s-hide-mobile"><a href="#contato" class="s-btn s-btn-secondary s-btn-sm"><span>Fale conosco</span></a></div></div></div></div></header><section class="s-section s-2ggkcf639kq"><div class="s-inner"><div class="s-container s-10u0ihjy3y5"><h1 class="s-t-h1 s-1x28k8mzq8g">Organize, automatize e cresça com um só aplicativo</h1><div class="s-rich s-t-lead s-1tqew206mmp"><p>Tudo o que sua equipe precisa para vender e atender melhor, num lugar só. Teste grátis por 14 dias, sem cartão.</p></div><div class="s-container s-22gd9os8g2w"><div class="s-button s-uexhr5c1ic"><a href="#planos" class="s-btn s-btn-secondary s-btn-lg"><span>Testar grátis</span></a></div><div class="s-button s-wossobog28"><a href="#como-funciona" class="s-btn s-btn-outline s-btn-lg"><span>Ver como funciona</span></a></div></div></div><div class="s-image s-m34zb4fxwx"><img class="s-media" src="/landing-page-templates/saas-subscription/hero-mockup.png" alt="Tela do aplicativo com o painel de vendas" width="1696" height="1124" loading="eager" decoding="sync" fetchPriority="high"/></div></div></section><section class="s-section s-208b2rsuvix"><div class="s-inner"><div class="s-rich s-t-small s-1oawwfpdqyo"><p>Empresas que já crescem com a gente</p></div><div class="s-container s-166wa9ac1rv"><div class="s-image s-1l6mzrbvo6z"><img class="s-media" src="/landing-page-templates/job-site/logo-askimat.png" alt="Logo da Askimat" width="308" height="60" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><div class="s-image s-1l6mzrbvo6z"><img class="s-media" src="/landing-page-templates/job-site/logo-coworks.png" alt="Logo da Coworks" width="292" height="48" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><div class="s-image s-1l6mzrbvo6z"><img class="s-media" src="/landing-page-templates/job-site/logo-dorfus.png" alt="Logo da Dorfus" width="294" height="56" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><div class="s-image s-1l6mzrbvo6z"><img class="s-media" src="/landing-page-templates/job-site/logo-greener.png" alt="Logo da Greener" width="296" height="60" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><div class="s-image s-1l6mzrbvo6z"><img class="s-media" src="/landing-page-templates/job-site/logo-makeless.png" alt="Logo da Makeless" width="280" height="48" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><div class="s-image s-1l6mzrbvo6z"><img class="s-media" src="/landing-page-templates/job-site/logo-saastoday.png" alt="Logo da Saastoday" width="310" height="62" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div></div></div></section><section class="s-section s-2fk0ria97tj"><div class="s-inner"><div class="s-container s-1ffkbp27wcn"><div class="s-rich s-t-overline s-1xcmyuc70jr"><p>Por que nos escolher</p></div><h2 class="s-t-h2 s-1x28k8mzq8g">Quem trabalha com a gente recebe o melhor de nós</h2></div><div class="s-container s-16y3f975j1r"><div class="s-container s-120dvkedc1n"><div class="s-icon s-141ya9nhvvi"><span class="s-icon-box"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M7.5 19.5C7.5 18.5344 7.82853 17.5576 8.63092 17.0204C9.59321 16.3761 10.7524 16 12 16C13.2476 16 14.4068 16.3761 15.3691 17.0204C16.1715 17.5576 16.5 18.5344 16.5 19.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></path><circle cx="12" cy="11" r="2.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></circle><path d="M17.5 11C18.6101 11 19.6415 11.3769 20.4974 12.0224C21.2229 12.5696 21.5 13.4951 21.5 14.4038V14.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></path><circle cx="17.5" cy="6.5" r="2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></circle><path d="M6.5 11C5.38987 11 4.35846 11.3769 3.50256 12.0224C2.77706 12.5696 2.5 13.4951 2.5 14.4038V14.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></path><circle cx="6.5" cy="6.5" r="2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></circle></svg></span></div><h3 class="s-t-h5 s-2vfrsglfco">Gerente de projeto dedicado</h3><div class="s-rich s-t-body s-1tzal0dqc7x"><p>Uma pessoa acompanha seu projeto do começo ao fim.</p></div></div><div class="s-container s-120dvkedc1n"><div class="s-icon s-2325yb16mpo"><span class="s-icon-box"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M8.64298 3.14559L6.93816 3.93362C4.31272 5.14719 3 5.75397 3 6.75C3 7.74603 4.31272 8.35281 6.93817 9.56638L8.64298 10.3544C10.2952 11.1181 11.1214 11.5 12 11.5C12.8786 11.5 13.7048 11.1181 15.357 10.3544L17.0618 9.56638C19.6873 8.35281 21 7.74603 21 6.75C21 5.75397 19.6873 5.14719 17.0618 3.93362L15.357 3.14559C13.7048 2.38186 12.8786 2 12 2C11.1214 2 10.2952 2.38186 8.64298 3.14559Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></path><path d="M20.788 11.0972C20.9293 11.2959 21 11.5031 21 11.7309C21 12.7127 19.6873 13.3109 17.0618 14.5072L15.357 15.284C13.7048 16.0368 12.8786 16.4133 12 16.4133C11.1214 16.4133 10.2952 16.0368 8.64298 15.284L6.93817 14.5072C4.31272 13.3109 3 12.7127 3 11.7309C3 11.5031 3.07067 11.2959 3.212 11.0972" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></path><path d="M20.3767 16.2661C20.7922 16.5971 21 16.927 21 17.3176C21 18.2995 19.6873 18.8976 17.0618 20.0939L15.357 20.8707C13.7048 21.6236 12.8786 22 12 22C11.1214 22 10.2952 21.6236 8.64298 20.8707L6.93817 20.0939C4.31272 18.8976 3 18.2995 3 17.3176C3 16.927 3.20778 16.5971 3.62334 16.2661" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg></span></div><h3 class="s-t-h5 s-2vfrsglfco">Tarefas organizadas</h3><div class="s-rich s-t-body s-1tzal0dqc7x"><p>Cada entrega tem prazo, responsável e status à vista.</p></div></div><div class="s-container s-120dvkedc1n"><div class="s-icon s-1qd7t4ruayh"><span class="s-icon-box"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M8.5 14.5H15.5M8.5 9.5H12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></path><path d="M14.1706 20.8905C18.3536 20.6125 21.6856 17.2332 21.9598 12.9909C22.0134 12.1607 22.0134 11.3009 21.9598 10.4707C21.6856 6.22838 18.3536 2.84913 14.1706 2.57107C12.7435 2.47621 11.2536 2.47641 9.8294 2.57107C5.64639 2.84913 2.31441 6.22838 2.04024 10.4707C1.98659 11.3009 1.98659 12.1607 2.04024 12.9909C2.1401 14.536 2.82343 15.9666 3.62791 17.1746C4.09501 18.0203 3.78674 19.0758 3.30021 19.9978C2.94941 20.6626 2.77401 20.995 2.91484 21.2351C3.05568 21.4752 3.37026 21.4829 3.99943 21.4982C5.24367 21.5285 6.08268 21.1757 6.74868 20.6846C7.1264 20.4061 7.31527 20.2668 7.44544 20.2508C7.5756 20.2348 7.83177 20.3403 8.34401 20.5513C8.8044 20.7409 9.33896 20.8579 9.8294 20.8905C11.2536 20.9852 12.7435 20.9854 14.1706 20.8905Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg></span></div><h3 class="s-t-h5 s-2vfrsglfco">Feedback sem ruído</h3><div class="s-rich s-t-body s-1tzal0dqc7x"><p>Comente direto nas telas e veja tudo virar ajuste.</p></div></div><div class="s-container s-120dvkedc1n"><div class="s-icon s-141ya9nhvvi"><span class="s-icon-box"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></circle><path d="M12 8V12L14 14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg></span></div><h3 class="s-t-h5 s-2vfrsglfco">Prazo é compromisso</h3><div class="s-rich s-t-body s-1tzal0dqc7x"><p>Cronograma realista e combinado antes de começar.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section id="como-funciona" class="s-section s-g3o8oft4eh"><div class="s-inner"><div class="s-container s-1ffkbp27wcn"><div class="s-rich s-t-overline s-1xcmyuc70jr"><p>Como funciona</p></div><h2 class="s-t-h2 s-1x28k8mzq8g">Do primeiro contato ao resultado em três passos</h2></div><div class="s-container s-10n6ex4qxct"><div class="s-container s-zbqpi1z7m7"><div class="s-rich s-t-lead s-m89pr1fuq8"><p>01</p></div><h3 class="s-t-h4 s-1x28k8mzq8g">Conversa inicial</h3><div class="s-rich s-t-body s-1oawwfpdqyo"><p>Entendemos seu momento, seus objetivos e o que já foi tentado.</p></div></div><div class="s-container s-zbqpi1z7m7"><div class="s-rich s-t-lead s-slj3tsavtk"><p>02</p></div><h3 class="s-t-h4 s-1x28k8mzq8g">Plano sob medida</h3><div class="s-rich s-t-body s-1oawwfpdqyo"><p>Você recebe um plano com etapas, prazos e investimento claros.</p></div></div><div class="s-container s-zbqpi1z7m7"><div class="s-rich s-t-lead s-1k0kpnfzbud"><p>03</p></div><h3 class="s-t-h4 s-1x28k8mzq8g">Execução e resultado</h3><div class="s-rich s-t-body s-1oawwfpdqyo"><p>Colocamos em prática e acompanhamos os números com você.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section id="depoimentos" class="s-section s-2fk0ria97tj"><div class="s-inner"><div class="s-container s-waizmwkz6h"><div class="s-icon s-1kdrxdh54ha"><span class="s-icon-box"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M10 8C10 9.88562 10 10.8284 9.41421 11.4142C8.82843 12 7.88562 12 6 12C4.11438 12 3.17157 12 2.58579 11.4142C2 10.8284 2 9.88562 2 8C2 6.11438 2 5.17157 2.58579 4.58579C3.17157 4 4.11438 4 6 4C7.88562 4 8.82843 4 9.41421 4.58579C10 5.17157 10 6.11438 10 8Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></path><path d="M10 7L10 11.4821C10 15.4547 7.48429 18.8237 4 20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5"></path><path d="M22 8C22 9.88562 22 10.8284 21.4142 11.4142C20.8284 12 19.8856 12 18 12C16.1144 12 15.1716 12 14.5858 11.4142C14 10.8284 14 9.88562 14 8C14 6.11438 14 5.17157 14.5858 4.58579C15.1716 4 16.1144 4 18 4C19.8856 4 20.8284 4 21.4142 4.58579C22 5.17157 22 6.11438 22 8Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></path><path d="M22 7L22 11.4821C22 15.4547 19.4843 18.8237 16 20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg></span></div><div class="s-rich s-t-lead s-l2wsugbceh"><p>“Ganhamos um site novo em poucas semanas, fácil de editar e que já trouxe mais contatos no primeiro mês.”</p></div><div class="s-container s-1ktcye82jox"><div class="s-image s-20aj27xy41j"><img class="s-media" src="/landing-page-templates/agency/testimonial-avatar-1.png" alt="Foto de Fernanda Lima" width="328" height="328" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><div class="s-container s-1skx6wplxo1"><div class="s-rich s-t-body s-2vfrsglfco"><p><strong>Fernanda Lima</strong></p></div><div class="s-rich s-t-small s-1tzal0dqc7x"><p>Diretora de marketing</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="planos" class="s-section s-g3o8oft4eh"><div class="s-inner"><div class="s-container s-1ffkbp27wcn"><div class="s-rich s-t-overline s-1xcmyuc70jr"><p>Planos</p></div><h2 class="s-t-h2 s-1x28k8mzq8g">Escolha o plano ideal para o seu momento</h2><div class="s-rich s-t-lead s-1oawwfpdqyo"><p>Sem fidelidade. Mude de plano quando quiser.</p></div></div><div class="s-container s-1cgyfnbjtun"><div class="s-container s-120dvkedc1n"><h3 class="s-t-h5 s-2vfrsglfco">Essencial</h3><div class="s-container s-vyxd8k5xty"><div class="s-rich s-t-lead s-1bjhx63cplq"><p><strong>R$ 49</strong></p></div><div class="s-rich s-t-small s-1tzal0dqc7x"><p>/mês</p></div></div><div class="s-rich s-t-body s-1tzal0dqc7x"><p>Para quem está começando.</p></div><hr class="s-divider s-jhon8f7616"/><ul class="s-list s-list-check s-t-body s-2g563xfjuhq"><li><span class="s-marker"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M22 12C22 6.47715 17.5228 2 12 2C6.47715 2 2 6.47715 2 12C2 17.5228 6.47715 22 12 22C17.5228 22 22 17.5228 22 12Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></path><path d="M8 12.5L10.5 15L16 9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg></span><span>1 usuário</span></li><li><span class="s-marker"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M22 12C22 6.47715 17.5228 2 12 2C6.47715 2 2 6.47715 2 12C2 17.5228 6.47715 22 12 22C17.5228 22 22 17.5228 22 12Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></path><path d="M8 12.5L10.5 15L16 9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg></span><span>Site com até 5 páginas</span></li><li><span class="s-marker"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M22 12C22 6.47715 17.5228 2 12 2C6.47715 2 2 6.47715 2 12C2 17.5228 6.47715 22 12 22C17.5228 22 22 17.5228 22 12Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></path><path d="M8 12.5L10.5 15L16 9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg></span><span>Suporte por e-mail</span></li></ul><div class="s-button s-2bo9uxlk77q"><a href="#contato" class="s-btn s-btn-outline"><span>Assinar agora</span></a></div></div><div class="s-container s-1ehg7jew813"><h3 class="s-t-h5 s-w0i6vmtoff">Profissional</h3><div class="s-container s-vyxd8k5xty"><div class="s-rich s-t-lead s-pjm2jic0ip"><p><strong>R$ 129</strong></p></div><div class="s-rich s-t-small s-w0i6vmtoff"><p>/mês</p></div></div><div class="s-rich s-t-body s-w0i6vmtoff"><p>Para equipes em crescimento.</p></div><hr class="s-divider s-1xif63vribc"/><ul class="s-list s-list-check s-t-body s-1quaxa4fcpl"><li><span class="s-marker"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M22 12C22 6.47715 17.5228 2 12 2C6.47715 2 2 6.47715 2 12C2 17.5228 6.47715 22 12 22C17.5228 22 22 17.5228 22 12Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></path><path d="M8 12.5L10.5 15L16 9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg></span><span>5 usuários</span></li><li><span class="s-marker"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M22 12C22 6.47715 17.5228 2 12 2C6.47715 2 2 6.47715 2 12C2 17.5228 6.47715 22 12 22C17.5228 22 22 17.5228 22 12Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></path><path d="M8 12.5L10.5 15L16 9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg></span><span>Páginas ilimitadas</span></li><li><span class="s-marker"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M22 12C22 6.47715 17.5228 2 12 2C6.47715 2 2 6.47715 2 12C2 17.5228 6.47715 22 12 22C17.5228 22 22 17.5228 22 12Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></path><path d="M8 12.5L10.5 15L16 9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg></span><span>Formulários no CRM</span></li><li><span class="s-marker"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M22 12C22 6.47715 17.5228 2 12 2C6.47715 2 2 6.47715 2 12C2 17.5228 6.47715 22 12 22C17.5228 22 22 17.5228 22 12Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></path><path d="M8 12.5L10.5 15L16 9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg></span><span>Suporte prioritário</span></li></ul><div class="s-button s-2bo9uxlk77q"><a href="#contato" class="s-btn s-btn-secondary"><span>Assinar agora</span></a></div></div><div class="s-container s-120dvkedc1n"><h3 class="s-t-h5 s-2vfrsglfco">Empresa</h3><div class="s-container s-vyxd8k5xty"><div class="s-rich s-t-lead s-1bjhx63cplq"><p><strong>R$ 299</strong></p></div><div class="s-rich s-t-small s-1tzal0dqc7x"><p>/mês</p></div></div><div class="s-rich s-t-body s-1tzal0dqc7x"><p>Para operações maiores.</p></div><hr class="s-divider s-jhon8f7616"/><ul class="s-list s-list-check s-t-body s-2g563xfjuhq"><li><span class="s-marker"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M22 12C22 6.47715 17.5228 2 12 2C6.47715 2 2 6.47715 2 12C2 17.5228 6.47715 22 12 22C17.5228 22 22 17.5228 22 12Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></path><path d="M8 12.5L10.5 15L16 9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg></span><span>Usuários ilimitados</span></li><li><span class="s-marker"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M22 12C22 6.47715 17.5228 2 12 2C6.47715 2 2 6.47715 2 12C2 17.5228 6.47715 22 12 22C17.5228 22 22 17.5228 22 12Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></path><path d="M8 12.5L10.5 15L16 9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg></span><span>Domínio próprio</span></li><li><span class="s-marker"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M22 12C22 6.47715 17.5228 2 12 2C6.47715 2 2 6.47715 2 12C2 17.5228 6.47715 22 12 22C17.5228 22 22 17.5228 22 12Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></path><path d="M8 12.5L10.5 15L16 9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg></span><span>Gerente de conta</span></li><li><span class="s-marker"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M22 12C22 6.47715 17.5228 2 12 2C6.47715 2 2 6.47715 2 12C2 17.5228 6.47715 22 12 22C17.5228 22 22 17.5228 22 12Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></path><path d="M8 12.5L10.5 15L16 9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg></span><span>SLA de atendimento</span></li></ul><div class="s-button s-2bo9uxlk77q"><a href="#contato" class="s-btn s-btn-outline"><span>Assinar agora</span></a></div></div></div></div></section><section class="s-section s-2fk0ria97tj"><div class="s-inner"><div class="s-container s-1ffkbp27wcn"><div class="s-rich s-t-overline s-1xcmyuc70jr"><p>Dúvidas</p></div><h2 class="s-t-h2 s-1x28k8mzq8g">Perguntas frequentes</h2></div><div class="s-container s-149o5mtblyp"><div class="s-container s-vn54hf2sdd"><h3 class="s-t-h5 s-2vfrsglfco">Quanto tempo leva um projeto?</h3><div class="s-rich s-t-body s-1tzal0dqc7x"><p>Projetos simples ficam prontos em duas semanas; os maiores seguem o cronograma combinado no plano.</p></div></div><div class="s-container s-vn54hf2sdd"><h3 class="s-t-h5 s-2vfrsglfco">Posso cancelar quando quiser?</h3><div class="s-rich s-t-body s-1tzal0dqc7x"><p>Sim. Não há fidelidade: você cancela pelo painel e não paga mais nada no mês seguinte.</p></div></div><div class="s-container s-vn54hf2sdd"><h3 class="s-t-h5 s-2vfrsglfco">Vocês atendem empresas de todo o Brasil?</h3><div class="s-rich s-t-body s-1tzal0dqc7x"><p>Sim, trabalhamos de forma remota com reuniões por vídeo e um canal direto no WhatsApp.</p></div></div><div class="s-container s-vn54hf2sdd"><h3 class="s-t-h5 s-2vfrsglfco">Como funciona o suporte?</h3><div class="s-rich s-t-body s-1tzal0dqc7x"><p>Você fala com pessoas de verdade por e-mail e chat, em horário comercial, com resposta no mesmo dia.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section id="contato" class="s-section s-ind8ts8ai9"><div class="s-inner"><div class="s-container s-7nohcio9v"><h2 class="s-t-h3 s-1x28k8mzq8g">Receba novidades e conteúdos exclusivos</h2><div class="s-rich s-t-body s-1tqew206mmp"><p>Uma vez por mês, direto no seu e-mail. Sem spam — cancele quando quiser.</p></div></div></div></section><footer class="s-section s-3522v7syv5"><div class="s-inner"><div class="s-container s-1ifvvm5zgjn"><div class="s-container s-of5l9ghgb"><div class="s-rich s-t-lead s-cch9w5bisp"><p><strong>Aurora</strong></p></div><div class="s-rich s-t-body s-ncphzp9er0"><p>Estratégia, design e tecnologia 